  <h2>12. Exam-style Questions</h2>

  <div class="box">
    <ul>
      <li>What does national income measure?</li>
      <li>Explain the difference between nominal income and real income.</li>
      <li>Why is real national income a better indicator of economic performance than nominal national income?</li>
      <li>Explain the meaning of income = output = expenditure.</li>
      <li>Explain the difference between injections and withdrawals.</li>
